SUMMARY:Psychic Circle with Senseful Wellness
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nLet’s come together and share our magic
 . Whether you’re new to this work or frequently tune into your intuitive
  psychic channel\, this space is about group support. Together in circle\,
  we’ll meditate and explore our individual energetic gifts.\n\nThis will
  be a safe space for anyone new to this work. Come with an open mind\, hea
 rt and let’s support one another.\n\n*Donation based*
