SUMMARY:Meditation class 
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nDavid will teach and lead you in a silent
  or continuous mantra technique. He has been practicing meditation for ove
 r 50 years. Sharing\, Q & A and walking meditation will also be included. 
 Check out the new Sow & Grow Meditation timer app which features David's t
 eachings. https://sowandgrow meditation.org/timer\n\nDrop-ins are welcome 
 or sign up on the mind body app. By donation
