SUMMARY:Cultivating Connection Playshops with Rebekah Joy
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin Rebekah Joy for a series designed to
  ignite connection in our relationships and communities in a time of polar
 ization. As we gather weekly\, we will explore ways to connect authentical
 ly with those around us through a variety of activities.\n\nThe series is 
 designed to enable attendees to apply what they have learned and expand it
  into their own offerings\, personal practices\, and community connections
 . Where appropriate\, I will provide resource spreadsheets\, printable gra
 phics\, handouts\, and videos for continued reference.\n\nEach Playshop is
  guided by a gentle structure. We open & close in a circle for reflection 
 and conversation on cultivating healthy connection and compassion in a tim
 e of polarization.\n\nThis is a pay-what-you-can / donation-based series.\
 n\n**When:** Mondays in April\n**Time:** 7:00 - 8:30 PM\n**Location:** Ene
 rgetic Experiences 81 Weaverville Rd\, Suite 2 Asheville\, NC 28804\n**Con
 tact:** Rebekah Luhrs\; Cell: 865-924-9411\; E-mail: [rebekah.luhrs@gmail.
 com](mailto:rebekah.luhrs@gmail.com)\n\nAPRIL 4 - Connection with Neighbor
 s: **Care Packages for Unhoused Neighbors**\n\nAPRIL 13 - Connection witho
 ut solutions: **Open When Letter Box**\n\nAPRIL 20 - Connection through Sa
 fe Touch: **Thai Massage: Supine**\n\nAPRIL 27 - Connection through Safe T
 ouch: **Thai Massage: Prone**\n\n***Space limited. To RSVP\, fill out the 
 form below.***\n**RSVP link**: [tinyurl.com/ym7ta2z8](http://tinyurl.com/y
 m7ta2z8)
