SUMMARY:Game Night
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nCome gather for a night of play\, connect
 ion\, and meaningful conversation.\n\nGame Night at Energetic Experiences 
 is an invitation to unwind while exploring yourself and others in a relaxe
 d\, welcoming space. We’ll have a selection of in-depth\, self-developme
 nt games available.\nThese are designed to spark insight\, deepen connecti
 on\, and open the door to conversations you might not have anywhere else.\
 n\nYou’re also welcome to bring your own games\, whether they’re light
 hearted\, thought-provoking\, or somewhere in between. Come solo or with f
 riends. Either way\, you’ll find yourself in good company.\n\nThis is a 
 casual\, community-centered evening where you can drop in\, play\, connect
 \, and follow what feels fun and engaging in the moment.\n\nFeel free to b
 ring snacks to share\, if you’d like. Complimentary water and tea will b
 e available.\n\nDonations are welcome to support the space and help us con
 tinue offering gatherings like this.\n\nAll are welcome.
