SUMMARY:Intuitive Development Circle
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nTO REGISTER:\n\nPlease **complete [THIS F
 ORM](https://www.robynmichelle.co/asheville-circle-reg-form)** before your
  first circle.\nYour spot is confirmed once payment is submitted (instruct
 ions at the bottom of the form).\n\n[RobynMichelle.co](http://RobynMichell
 e.co/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExekNlWWtTR3E4TUgxSVkwc3NydGMGYXBwX2l
 kEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4orfnQZ6evTVnaSws6JDwuLfdfgtdjtEjMy71swGeQSzeZM
 j5SI6Z6tzYVXQ_aem_1dpaIbyHHxfj7TpLMzrP-g)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Asheville Intuitive Develop
 ment Circle**\n\n-2nd & 4th Tuesdays\n-7:00–8:30 PM\n-The Well\, Ashevil
 le\n\nThe Asheville Intuitive Development Circle is an in-person\, experie
 ntial gathering for exploring and strengthening intuition in a grounded\, 
 low-pressure\, and supportive environment.\n\nThis circle welcomes all exp
 erience levels - from total beginners to those with an established intuiti
 ve or spiritual practice. No prior experience is required.\n\nRather than 
 focusing on “getting it right\,” this circle emphasizes practice\, cur
 iosity\, and self-trust.\n\n**What participants often gain:**\n-Greater co
 nfidence in inner knowing\n-Improved ability to discern intuition vs. imag
 ination or external energy\n-A clearer sense of energetic and emotional bo
 undaries\n-More trust in how intuition shows up uniquely for them\n-Experi
 ence practicing intuition in a safe\, non-performative space\n-Reduced pre
 ssure to have answers or certainty\n-A deeper sense of grounding and prese
 nce\n-Connection with others exploring intuition thoughtfully and responsi
 bly\n\n**What to expect:**\nEach gathering may include a blend of:\n-Guide
 d meditations to help you settle and get receptive\n-Solo\, partner\, and 
 group exercises to practice intuitive awareness\n-Exploration of an intuit
 ive tool such as:\n\\-\\-\\-the clair senses\n\\-\\-\\-remote viewing\n\\-
 \\-\\-symbology\n\\-\\-\\-energetic hygiene and boundaries\n\\-\\-\\-spiri
 t guides\n\\-\\-\\-intuitive art and creative practices\n-Space for reflec
 tion\, discussion\, and integration\n\nTopics may shift from circle to cir
 cle depending on group interests and experience level.\n\n**Values & Appro
 ach:**\nThis circle emphasizes:\n-Grounding and healthy energetic boundari
 es\n-Curiosity over certainty\n-Empowerment rather than dependency\n\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nTO REGISTER:\nPlease **complete
  [THIS FORM](https://www.robynmichelle.co/asheville-circle-reg-form)** bef
 ore your first circle.\nYour spot is confirmed once payment is submitted (
 instructions at the bottom of the form).\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nQuestions or inquiries about 1-on-1 mentorship\,
  readings\, or mediumship classes: robynmichellemedium@gmail.com\n\n[Robyn
 Michelle.co](RobynMichelle.co)
